{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model integrating imagenet_vit_l image encoders with the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (multiprofile, avgpool) using concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.7150) and F1 (0.6872) exceed the RNA-only state-of-the-art (0.6501 accuracy), suggesting multimodal integration may improve performance. Uncertainty remains about the optimal image encoder and fusion strategy, as this setup uses specific choices without testing alternatives."
}

